/-!
# F59-F20 / v5.168 — original typed F55 square-only source rigidity

The EXACT F59-F19 target repair changes precisely 27 true C60
F55 square labels (companion file). Can it be promoted back to F55
original freely presented HIGHER PATH SYNTAX?

This file formalizes the maximal fragment generated by ONE ACTUAL
parallel pair of original F54 disjoint-rotation routes, its original
