every type-correct finite vertical composite of those witnesses.
All members retain their EXACT original source and target routes.

A dependent Bool-indexed SOURCE word is recursively converted to
the REAL original F55 PresentedCell, not a mock target expression.
Its original-independent F59 native braidedPhase interpreter is
proved to be IDENTICALLY the endpoint square generator difference.

Consequently every such source word joining the original SAME
fixed squareLeftFirst route to squareRightFirst evaluates to exactly
