insertion of squares/inverses/identities/vertical compositions cannot
alter the target edge label. Thus:
  * no field of these honest square-only source words is C60-flat;
  * the explicit 27-edge canonical flat TARGET repair cannot lift
    to fixed-route square-only F55 source words.

IMPORTANT SCOPE: this does NOT rule out richer original F55
PresentedCell terms using pentagon, whiskering or contextual
path constructors, or modified boundary routes. The unproved
full source global Gray coherence / historical Stage-II omega
comparison is NOT manufactured by this local fragment theorem.
